{50}{This here pub is called Caleb Malloy's.  It's the best place in the Boil to get yourself a drink, and find out what's new on the street.  There's a lot of the Clan Maug in here, too, but Malloy's is no-man's land...Pollock told us no fighting in here, and so we don't start trouble...}{This here pub is called Caleb Malloy's.  It's the best place in the Boil to get yourself a drink, and find out what's new on the street.  There's a lot of the Clan Maug in here, too, but Malloy's is no-man's land...Pollock told us no fighting in here, and so we don't start trouble...}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
