{56}{Clan Maug?  Bunch of weak-spined blokes who live in the North Boil.  Orcs and half-orcs, mostly.  Their boss goes by the name a' Darian Maug, and he lives in the Bentley...fancy building just north a' here.  Bloody flaming prince, hidin' behind his nice little house.  [He spits on the ground.]  I'd like to get my hands on him...}{Clan Maug?  Bunch of weak-spined blokes who live in the North Boil.  Orcs and half-orcs, mostly.  Their boss goes by the name a' Darian Maug, and he lives in the Bentley...fancy building just north a' here.  Bloody flaming prince, hidin' behind his nice little house.  [He spits on the ground.]  I'd like to get my hands on him...}{}{}{}{}
